  m_text: '<b>The Last Memory</b> - a student project made with Unity and C#

    <b>Story,
    design, code, and the tree, note, lantern, cottage and Lia sprites</b> - made
    for this project


    <b>Hero</b> - Adventurer Hero by STAEL

    <b>Forest,
    ruins, dragon</b> - Pixel Art Platformer Asset Pack by Glax (CC0)

    <b>Castle</b>
    - Spooky Castle Tileset (OpenGameArt)

    <b>Enemies</b> - 2D Platformer Enemies
    (OpenGameArt)

    <b>Gems</b> - Cave Platformer Tileset by Rotting Pixels

    <b>Keys</b>
    - CC0 Key Icons by 7Soul1

    <b>Chests</b> - Animated Pixel Art Treasure Chests
    by Yevhen Babiichuk (DustDFG), CC-BY 4.0

    <b>Portals</b> - Portals (OpenGameArt)

    <b>Music</b>
    - "8-bit Perilous Dungeon" & "8-bit Slay the Evil" by HydroGene, "Spooky Dungeon"
    by Memoraphile

    <b>Sound effects</b> - Kenney Impact & Interface Sounds (CC0)


    Full
    details: Docs/ASSET_CREDITS.md'
